Q. Another measure, on loads that were not searched for it: the root mean square of the misses (40 rings; finite differences)
   1.43 skins: the lowest mode free, 7 misses: 0.099%; the lowest mode tuned, 8 misses against the lowest mode: 0.698%; the same load, 8 misses against half the second mode: 0.998%
   4 skins: the lowest mode free, 7 misses: 0.070%; the lowest mode tuned, 8 misses against the lowest mode: 0.523%; the same load, 8 misses against half the second mode: 0.715%
   12 skins: the lowest mode free, 7 misses: 0.058%; the lowest mode tuned, 8 misses against the lowest mode: 0.510%; the same load, 8 misses against half the second mode: 0.645%
